    "body": "This conflicts with main (now d7e9a807). Eight files, all same-logic changes rather than both-sides-added, so it needs the author's judgement: `crates/app/src/operation/job.rs` + `stamp.rs` (main restructured the tool fetch and the #369 lathe-body refusal), `posting.rs` (main moved the family door into `posting_family::family_at_post` - your #532 wire clause should ride inside that, not beside it), `crates/post/src/machine/edm.rs` + `mod.rs` (main's `edm_refusals`/`SINKER_KEYS`/`WIRE_KEYS` rework vs your `condition(..)` door), `crates/app/tests/golden_cl.rs` (gate-map line), `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs` (`op_icon` match), and `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` (18 vs 29 - take the next free number above main). Please `git merge upstream/main`, keep both laws at each site, and push.\n",
