    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 10b7788707da359d92f392f21e35b3428cf2658f -->\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.** The review submitted at 23:53Z repeated the previous head's text by mistake; this comment replaces it.\n\n**Blockers from the previous review: both closed**\n1. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` is 43; `origin/main` is at 42, so 43 is the next number.\n2. `a_wire_contour_cannot_post_over_mcp_and_writes_no_file` (`crates/app/tests/mcp_wire_contour.rs:186`) generates the wire contour, calls `post`, and asserts a tool error naming the wire/EDM cut and that no file is written.\n\n**Merge check.** Trial merge with `origin/main` was \"Already up to date\". The diff against main is only the 7 PR files (PROCESS_VERSION, camcraft-mcp SKILL.md, mcp/edit.rs, mcp/job.rs, mcp/tools.rs, the test file, the decision note). Nothing from main was dropped.\n\n**Local results (merged with main)**\n| run | result |\n|---|---|\n| mcp_wire_contour | 4 passed |\n| mcp | 19 passed |\n| clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings | clean |\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
